{"kind":"artifact","text":"cmd/gs/session_snapshot.go at exact a440adaeea6b9037fc37856fb23ff341172018dc on request/status-size-cliff, under promise git:sha1…e8d5213 on request git:sha1…e780867\n\nRequest b2a5e83a: step commands keep using the resident's projection when its full status is over 64 MiB. Two commits over main 5876d211.\n\nDesign: the ceiling on the full /v0/status answer is now 64 MiB plus 8 KiB for each record in this checkout's own sequence. The count is gitstore.Store.Count (`rev-list --count --first-parent`) at the head read before the request. fetchFullStatus reads the ref, computes the ceiling, fetches, and checks the frontier against the ref read before the request. residentStatus now shares that path, so a head that moves during the read is caught by gs status --all/--json, artifacts and reviews too.\n\nConditions:\n1. Step commands use the resident's projection above 64 MiB. Pinned by TestSessionSnapshotCeilingGrowsWithTheLocalLog, TestStepCommandReadsAResidentAnswerPastTheOldCeiling and TestResidentStatusRefusesAHeadThatMovedDuringTheRead. Per planner assert e3d32bf4, the preflights of state, batch, ratify and supersede are their reference resolution only; their chain preflight folds locally by design, and request c4c2be71 tracks that cost.\n2. The MCP adapter never reads /v0/status. TestSelectiveToolsUseResidentSelectionWithoutFetchingStatus pins that.\n3. Memory: on the artroom copy, peak RSS opening gs land fell from 681 MB to 338–371 MB. The worst case at the ceiling at depth 43,744 is 1.87 GB, growing linearly; architecture.md states both.\n4. go test -timeout 40m ./... passes at a440adae.\n5. Artroom frozen copy, depth 43,744: gs work --next 50.3 s → 1.3 s; opening a gs land session 48.6 s → 0.8 s.\n\nMutations, each red at a named test: dropping the per-record term, ignoring the ceiling at the call site, checking the head only after the read, Count+1. An independent adversarial review requested changes; its findings on the worst-case memory and on who can raise the ceiling are repaired in a440adae.","body":{"commit":"a440adaeea6b9037fc37856fb23ff341172018dc","path":"cmd/gs/session_snapshot.go"}}